{
  "slug": "figma-suite",
  "name": "Figma Suite",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Design production-quality screens in Figma using your design system — every property variable-bound, every element a component instance. Build and edit Figma component libraries from code, sync design tokens bidirectionally (code ↔ Figma), and audit files for design system compliance. Requires the official Figma MCP server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `figma-suite` (Bidirectional design system sync between code and Figma — tokens/variables, components, and a Zod-validated code<->Figma component mapping —…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install figma-suite@claude-community` from `robukh/figma-suite`.",
